# Agents files — local agent-instruction scratch files, ignored anywhere in the
# tree. The repo's OWN AGENTS.md/CLAUDE.md predate these rules and stay tracked
# (an ignore rule never untracks an already-tracked file).
CLAUDE.md
AGENTS.md
# ...but `core.ignorecase=true` on macOS/Windows makes the rule above match ANY
# case, so a legitimately-new `docs/agents.md` was silently skipped by
# `git add -A` and shipped as a broken link (P8-ADOPT-01). Negate it explicitly.
!docs/agents.md